🧪 Testing Checklist
Pre-Release Tests

    Test on Ubuntu 22.04 (Steam native)
    Test on Ubuntu 22.04 (Flatpak Steam)
    Test on Fedora (dnf package manager)
    Test on Arch Linux (pacman)
    Test on openSUSE (zypper)
    Test with existing Skyve installation
    Test with fresh CSII installation
    Test with custom Steam library location
    Test interrupt handling (Ctrl+C at various points)
    Test with missing dependencies (protontricks not installed)
    Test desktop file creation and launch

Edge Cases

    User declines all optional features
    User provides invalid paths
    Disk space insufficient
    Network unavailable (for updates)
    Read-only filesystem
    Multiple Steam accounts on same machine

