🐛 Known Bugs (From Code Review)

    First script version: .NET 4.8 installation uses yes | protontricks ... & which runs in background but wait may not capture exit status correctly
    Both versions: No validation that Skyve.exe actually exists in detected directory
    Both versions: Icon fallback path may not exist on user's system
    Second script version: SKYVE_REL calculation assumes specific directory structure that may vary
    Both versions: No check for sufficient disk space before installation

